Query retained Archive outcomes, or submit the exact retained review

Usage: mxr archive-operation [OPTIONS] [OPERATION_ID]

Arguments:
  [OPERATION_ID]

Options:
      --submit
      --format <FORMAT>  Output format: table, json, jsonl, ids
  -h, --help             Print help
